msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:123
#: 44e6ad6b95e24ccf9e7692b786fe5a82 5e8315657753438a9347f5a61eb640c4
#: 7fdd6bcdb2be4638b2a9ad6f3d802333 9929a60007be4c7aa2bffd69076e999f
#: dcd85169628c46a7a0701c950081342e ea275d9f5ea8417e9251afce973a1979
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the Vsw pins which can be set to output either VFC (9/12V) "
"or 5V via a board jumper. Setting this GPIO high removes voltage supply to "
"pins. RELAY2 is configured by default to control this GPIO and is low by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制 Vsw 引脚，可通过板上跳线选择输出 VFC（9/12V）或 5V。将此 GPIO 拉高将切断引脚供电。RELAY2 "
"默认配置用于控制此 GPIO，默认为低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:125
#: 494e34f1d128422e943592098bd3a7dc 61f86411be114c8ca540c959832d9a22
#: 89f1ab1f8f23479f85009ab7c0be162d 91ab7850c3f745208a5f0b5914b467cc
#: 91f6794657554b42b54f1cc1ad32ea3d cadbdc609f28415587f8d964d27f1c62
msgid ""
"GPIO 83 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"9V/12V\"  included on "
"the HD VTX connector and VFC pads and is included on the HD VTX connector. "
"Setting this GPIO low removes voltage supply to this pin/pad. By default "
"RELAY4 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 83 控制 VTX BEC 输出到标有 「9V/12V」 的引脚（位于高清 VTX 连接器和 VFC 焊盘上）。将此 GPIO "
"拉低将切断该引脚/焊盘的供电。默认情况下 RELAY4 配置用于控制此引脚，并将 GPIO 设为高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:129
#: 5bb1ebf36e134911813ef49bd73c9009 873f5c035aa14a2eac51c1282c7a9151
